@int
title: Read A Book
subtitle: This increases Intelligence
choose-if: attr_manip_actions < 3
on-arrival: int_score += 1; int_score += 1 if attr_manip_read >= 12; int_score += 1 if attr_manip_read >= 24; attr_manip_actions += 1; attr_manip_read += 1

You read a book, and learn something 

- @main

@luk
